        "jsCode": "const sevenDaysAgo = new Date();\nsevenDaysAgo.setDate(sevenDaysAgo.getDate() - 7);\n\nconst expenses = $input.all()\n  .map(item => item.json)\n  .filter(expense => {\n    const parsed = new Date(expense[\"Date\"]);\n    return parsed >= sevenDaysAgo;\n  });\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      expenses\n    }\n  }\n];"
